# Video Intelligence worker / Ask video (P1)

Host-portable configuration — **do not** hard-code FlightSim or media-server hostnames in application code.

```text
# Sibling worker (P1 default host: FlightSim; portable)
MEMORYBOX_VIDEO_WORKER_HOST=127.0.0.1
MEMORYBOX_VIDEO_WORKER_PORT=8791

# Monolith → worker
MEMORYBOX_VIDEO_WORKER_URL=http://127.0.0.1:8791
MEMORYBOX_VIDEO_PROVIDER=hvrt
# or: fake | unavailable | auto

# Authoritative family-video library on media-server (LAN path / UNC)
MEMORYBOX_VIDEO_MEDIA_ROOT=\\media-server\path\to\family-videos

# Rebuildable derived detections (not PostgreSQL Person SoT)
MEMORYBOX_VIDEO_DERIVED_DIR=C:\memorybox_data\video_derived

# Presence span merge gap (seconds). Sensible P1 default=60. Settings UI later.
MEMORYBOX_VIDEO_PRESENCE_GAP_SEC=60
```

Original video files are **read-only**. Owner-confirmed Person teaching lives in MemoryBox PostgreSQL and survives worker reprocess.
